1
00:00:44,550 --> 00:00:45,400
[Unsoiled Starlight]

2
00:00:45,420 --> 00:00:47,040
[Episode 11]

3
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:47,410
[Adapted from Migu's novel
"Unsoiled Starlight"]

4
00:00:47,440 --> 00:00:47,960
[Original Author: Shan Gu Jun]

5
00:00:48,410 --> 00:00:52,500
[Main Hall]

6
00:00:56,710 --> 00:00:59,660
[Pure Land on Earth]

7
00:00:57,720 --> 00:00:58,680
I didn't expect you

8
00:00:58,680 --> 00:00:59,800
to believe in this.

9
00:01:01,080 --> 00:01:02,800
There are things

10
00:01:02,830 --> 00:01:04,000
you can't decide.

11
00:01:04,480 --> 00:01:05,920
You can only pray.

12
00:01:06,520 --> 00:01:07,720
When you got your fortune read,

13
00:01:07,720 --> 00:01:09,000
the master talked much to you.

14
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:09,860
What did he say?

15
00:01:11,360 --> 00:01:12,360
I got medium luck.

16
00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:13,960
It roughly means

17
00:01:14,480 --> 00:01:16,480
I can't have the best of both worlds.

18
00:01:16,920 --> 00:01:18,180
I have to make a choice.

19
00:01:19,120 --> 00:01:20,640
That's how things work..

20
00:01:20,840 --> 00:01:22,640
You have to lose some to gain some.

21
00:01:22,640 --> 00:01:23,760
Especially

22
00:01:23,920 --> 00:01:25,000
with your career.

23
00:01:25,240 --> 00:01:26,640
If you want to play it safe,

24
00:01:26,640 --> 00:01:28,500
it's hard to make a breakthrough.

25
00:01:32,400 --> 00:01:33,930
I'll take a look over there.

26
00:01:40,240 --> 00:01:42,170
But I wasn't praying for my career.

27
00:01:46,210 --> 00:01:48,430
[Pure Land on Earth]

28
00:01:48,720 --> 00:01:50,680
I was praying for marriage.

29
00:01:52,030 --> 00:01:55,680
[Main Hall]

30
00:02:00,840 --> 00:02:01,500
Is it for me?

31
00:02:02,040 --> 00:02:03,040
You don't want it?

32
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:03,900
Forget it then.

33
00:02:04,110 --> 00:02:04,670
I want!

34
00:02:11,510 --> 00:02:13,850
[Main Hall]

35
00:02:14,640 --> 00:02:16,300
I'm going to visit my parents.

36
00:02:16,920 --> 00:02:18,180
Would you come with me?

37
00:02:18,640 --> 00:02:20,200
Happy New Year.

38
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:21,400
I won't bother you.

39
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:23,460
When you come back,

40
00:02:23,600 --> 00:02:25,170
I have something to tell you.

41
00:02:25,170 --> 00:02:26,440
Can't you tell me now?

42
00:02:27,800 --> 00:02:28,720
Some things

43
00:02:28,950 --> 00:02:30,150
are not meant for now.

44
00:02:35,420 --> 00:02:40,710
[Main Hall]

45
00:02:39,130 --> 00:02:40,590
Two set of incense sticks.

46
00:02:47,930 --> 00:02:49,860
[Main Hall]

47
00:02:56,130 --> 00:03:00,520
[Main Hall]

48
00:03:12,080 --> 00:03:13,340
Still in the hospital?

49
00:03:14,320 --> 00:03:16,560
I'm going shopping with Lin Zhihuan.

50
00:03:19,720 --> 00:03:20,960
It's jamaican coffee.

51
00:03:20,960 --> 00:03:22,220
It tastes good. Try it.

52
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:23,920
Hello, aunties.

53
00:03:23,920 --> 00:03:24,720
Hello, Yu'an.

54
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:26,760
Mom.

55
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:32,090
I need to take a call.

56
00:03:32,090 --> 00:03:32,810
Go ahead.

57
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:37,940
Yu'an is getting more and more handsome.

58
00:03:37,940 --> 00:03:38,560
Exactly.

59
00:03:38,840 --> 00:03:39,760
Among the kids of his generation,

60
00:03:39,760 --> 00:03:41,360
Yu'an is the best.

61
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:43,040
Mature and poised.

62
00:03:43,040 --> 00:03:43,600
Reliable.

63
00:03:43,600 --> 00:03:44,020
Reliable.

64
00:03:44,020 --> 00:03:44,680
Yes.

65
00:03:44,680 --> 00:03:46,480
His career is really taking off.

66
00:03:46,480 --> 00:03:47,160
Indeed.

67
00:03:47,840 --> 00:03:49,240
Just small-time stuff.

68
00:03:49,760 --> 00:03:50,400
His dad

69
00:03:50,480 --> 00:03:52,070
doesn't want him messing with this.

70
00:03:52,070 --> 00:03:53,240
But he insists.

71
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:55,530
Hello, Wen Jian. What's up?

72
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:58,120
Just wishing you a happy New Year.

73
00:03:58,400 --> 00:03:59,660
What are you busy with?

74
00:04:00,300 --> 00:04:01,500
Dealing with family.

75
00:04:01,890 --> 00:04:04,000
Say hello to your parents for me.

76
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:07,000
Oh, right.

77
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:09,360
Yu'an is at the age to get married, right?

78
00:04:10,100 --> 00:04:12,000
Is there any suitable match for him?

79
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:13,800
I'm counting on you to set him up.

80
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:15,410
Hey, you know a girl, don't you?

81
00:04:15,410 --> 00:04:16,370
Oh, yes.

82
00:04:16,399 --> 00:04:17,959
I happen to know one..

83
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:18,839
She's quite nice.

84
00:04:18,839 --> 00:04:19,279
Really?

85
00:04:19,279 --> 00:04:20,680
Her dad is in real estate.

86
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:22,440
A perfect match for your family.

87
00:04:22,440 --> 00:04:23,800
I'll introduce you to her some other day.

88
00:04:23,800 --> 00:04:24,970
Bring her here.

89
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:26,560
I'll have the maid prepare some dishes.

90
00:04:26,560 --> 00:04:27,360
Okay.

91
00:04:34,840 --> 00:04:35,560
Later,

92
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:37,400
Aunt Li is bringing her daughter over.

93
00:04:37,400 --> 00:04:39,240
Have a good chat with the girl.

94
00:04:40,320 --> 00:04:41,080
Mom,

95
00:04:41,400 --> 00:04:42,800
I kept repeating myself.

96
00:04:43,240 --> 00:04:45,300
Stop interfering in my private life.

97
00:04:46,340 --> 00:04:48,040
I'm just worried about you.

98
00:04:48,120 --> 00:04:49,520
Look at you,

99
00:04:49,520 --> 00:04:51,400
you haven't dated in so long.

100
00:04:51,400 --> 00:04:53,400
What, you want to be single forever?

101
00:04:53,840 --> 00:04:54,970
I don't have the time

102
00:04:55,400 --> 00:04:56,480
or the energy

103
00:04:56,480 --> 00:04:58,080
to date someone I don't like.

104
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:00,210
Then tell me,

105
00:05:00,240 --> 00:05:01,100
who do you like?

106
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:02,640
Who is she?

107
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:04,840
Your partner, Wen Jian?

108
00:05:06,840 --> 00:05:08,040
You investigated me?

109
00:05:08,090 --> 00:05:11,560
[SenZhou Rehabilitation Hospital]

110
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:12,670
[Fire safety]

111
00:05:23,260 --> 00:05:25,910
[Outpatient Clinic]

112
00:05:30,370 --> 00:05:32,870
[Outpatient Clinic]

113
00:05:32,890 --> 00:05:37,030
[SenZhou Rehabilitation Hospital]

114
00:05:37,320 --> 00:05:37,880
Well...

115
00:05:38,520 --> 00:05:39,240
So what if I did?

116
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:40,570
What's wrong with that?

117
00:05:40,640 --> 00:05:41,720
I just expect you

118
00:05:41,720 --> 00:05:42,870
to find a girlfriend,

119
00:05:42,870 --> 00:05:43,720
get married,

120
00:05:43,720 --> 00:05:45,640
and give us a grandbabe soon.

121
00:05:46,120 --> 00:05:47,080
Honestly,

122
00:05:47,080 --> 00:05:48,680
I'm fed up with his sour face.

123
00:05:48,840 --> 00:05:49,920
Auntie Cheng,

124
00:05:50,480 --> 00:05:52,280
I'll tell my dad what you said,

125
00:05:52,640 --> 00:05:54,000
so he can have a good talk

126
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:55,240
with Uncle Zhuo.

127
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:58,240
You brat, you're such a smooth talker.

128
00:05:58,240 --> 00:05:59,159
Doesn't your mom pressure you?

129
00:05:59,159 --> 00:06:00,490
Her nagging is useless.

130
00:06:00,720 --> 00:06:01,980
I won't listen anyway.

131
00:06:02,160 --> 00:06:03,360
But Yu'an

132
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:04,840
is more obedient than me.

133
00:06:04,840 --> 00:06:05,920
Push a little harder,

134
00:06:05,920 --> 00:06:07,000
and it might just work.

135
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:07,640
Shut up.

136
00:06:08,100 --> 00:06:09,440
All right, enough talk.

137
00:06:09,520 --> 00:06:10,600
Keep trying, Auntie.

138
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:11,640
I'm on your side.

139
00:06:13,320 --> 00:06:14,200
See?

140
00:06:14,400 --> 00:06:15,800
He's so good at chatting.

141
00:06:15,920 --> 00:06:17,400
Then look at yourself.

142
00:06:17,840 --> 00:06:19,400
What a waste of your height

143
00:06:19,400 --> 00:06:20,400
and your handsome face.

144
00:06:20,400 --> 00:06:21,560
Come on, go flirt

145
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:22,760
with some girls out there!

146
00:06:22,760 --> 00:06:23,440
Mom,

147
00:06:23,560 --> 00:06:24,960
I'll say it one more time.

148
00:06:25,240 --> 00:06:27,300
Stop interfering in my private life.

149
00:06:27,800 --> 00:06:28,760
I know what to do.

150
00:06:31,040 --> 00:06:31,480
Hey.

151
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:32,360
I...

152
00:06:32,360 --> 00:06:33,690
I haven't finished yet.

153
00:06:34,200 --> 00:06:35,320
Bye, Auntie.

154
00:06:37,880 --> 00:06:39,040
Brat.

155
00:06:43,840 --> 00:06:45,560
Double-check the project.

156
00:06:45,560 --> 00:06:47,020
It's very important to us.

157
00:06:47,240 --> 00:06:47,840
Got it.

158
00:06:49,440 --> 00:06:50,040
Wen Jian.

159
00:06:51,840 --> 00:06:52,640
Go on.

160
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:55,760
What did you say to my mom?

161
00:06:57,640 --> 00:06:58,640
Sorry.

162
00:06:58,940 --> 00:07:00,840
I don't know what you're talking about.

163
00:07:00,840 --> 00:07:02,770
You visited my mom in the hospital.

164
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:04,860
Her condition finally improved,

165
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:06,730
and you just had to provoke her.

166
00:07:07,400 --> 00:07:08,840
Why did she end up like this?

167
00:07:08,840 --> 00:07:10,000
Don't you know?

168
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:11,240
Of course I know.

169
00:07:12,120 --> 00:07:14,050
That's exactly why I had to see her.

170
00:07:18,400 --> 00:07:19,200
Shu Tinglan,

171
00:07:20,240 --> 00:07:21,320
what happened?

172
00:07:25,690 --> 00:07:27,380
[Zhuoyuan Technology]

173
00:07:27,560 --> 00:07:28,360
Wen Jian,

174
00:07:28,560 --> 00:07:29,360
you...

175
00:07:35,159 --> 00:07:35,960
Tinglan.

176
00:07:46,960 --> 00:07:48,520
Bother my mom again,

177
00:07:49,120 --> 00:07:51,320
and you'll end up just like Shu Minghai!

178
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:53,840
As for you…

179
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:56,100
I don't want to know

180
00:07:56,280 --> 00:07:57,640
your choice anymore.

181
00:07:59,990 --> 00:08:00,720
Shu Tinglan!

182
00:08:00,730 --> 00:08:01,200
Yu'an!

183
00:08:11,520 --> 00:08:13,180
The meeting is in ten minutes.

184
00:08:14,000 --> 00:08:15,120
Let them wait.

185
00:08:23,560 --> 00:08:24,720
Show's over!

186
00:08:42,760 --> 00:08:46,940
[In Deep Mourning]

187
00:08:53,980 --> 00:08:56,950
[In Deep Mourning]

188
00:08:57,010 --> 00:08:59,710
[Tribute]

189
00:08:59,790 --> 00:09:01,250
It's been so many years...

190
00:09:02,400 --> 00:09:03,240
For so many years,

191
00:09:03,240 --> 00:09:05,840
Jian could only call him dad in secret.

192
00:09:07,160 --> 00:09:08,000
Now he's gone.

193
00:09:08,320 --> 00:09:09,320
For the last time,

194
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:10,720
I just want her

195
00:09:10,720 --> 00:09:12,720
to call him dad properly.

196
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:14,000
Dad!

197
00:09:14,720 --> 00:09:15,550
Dad!

198
00:09:16,910 --> 00:09:18,270
Dad!

199
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:20,880
Mom?

200
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:21,640
Mom?

201
00:09:22,080 --> 00:09:22,640
Mom!

202
00:09:23,200 --> 00:09:24,560
I've told you again and again.

203
00:09:24,560 --> 00:09:26,080
Jian and her mother have it hard.

204
00:09:26,080 --> 00:09:26,760
You should go easier on her.

205
00:09:26,760 --> 00:09:28,200
Your mother is in a very bad state.

206
00:09:28,200 --> 00:09:29,390
She often threatens to commit suicide!

207
00:09:29,390 --> 00:09:30,200
Tinglan,

208
00:09:30,330 --> 00:09:32,760
Shu Minghai is so cruel!

209
00:09:33,120 --> 00:09:33,960
Zhuo Yu'an,

210
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:36,000
only one between Wen Jian and me.

211
00:09:36,170 --> 00:09:37,170
Who do you choose?

212
00:09:41,650 --> 00:09:42,600
Shu Tinglan,

213
00:09:43,170 --> 00:09:44,600
what happened?

214
00:10:12,270 --> 00:10:13,280
Are you okay?

215
00:10:13,720 --> 00:10:14,600
Thank you.

216
00:10:17,480 --> 00:10:18,640
Excuse me.

217
00:11:03,140 --> 00:11:04,120
Shu Tinglan.

218
00:11:45,360 --> 00:11:46,080
Zhuo Yu'an,

219
00:11:46,680 --> 00:11:47,520
just go.

220
00:11:48,440 --> 00:11:50,570
I need to make sure you're really okay.

221
00:11:53,120 --> 00:11:54,000
I mean,

222
00:11:55,200 --> 00:11:56,320
I don't want any personal contact

223
00:11:56,320 --> 00:11:57,640
between us ever again.

224
00:11:59,160 --> 00:12:00,090
What do you mean?

225
00:12:00,960 --> 00:12:01,760
Tinglan?

226
00:12:04,040 --> 00:12:04,800
Tinglan?

227
00:12:05,200 --> 00:12:06,400
Make yourself clear.

228
00:12:06,480 --> 00:12:08,520
I'm really clueless!

229
00:12:19,640 --> 00:12:20,760
Shu Tinglan?

230
00:12:23,240 --> 00:12:24,120
Tinglan.

231
00:12:32,240 --> 00:12:33,080
What's this supposed to mean?
